@baseUrl = http://localhost:5255

### Designate the common account (replace the ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/common

### Current month's projection (404 until an account is designated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projection
Accept: application/json

### Custom monthly review sections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monthly-display-sections
Accept: application/json

### Create a section (replace the budget post IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monthly-display-sections
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Impôts","postIds":["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"]}

### Read a section (replace the ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monthly-display-sections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Update a section (replace the IDs)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/monthly-display-sections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Impôts du foyer","postIds":["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"]}

### Delete a section without deleting its posts (replace the ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/monthly-display-sections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List saved transactions (empty until transactions are added)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

### Update an operation's category, personal description and accounting period (replace the IDs)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/details
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","description":"Libellé personnel","budgetYear":2026,"budgetMonth":11}

### Enable individual assignments for a category (replace the ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/multi-post

### Return a category to normal mode (replace the ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/multi-post

### Assign an operation to a budget post (replace the IDs)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/budget-assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{"budgetPostId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","description":"Charnière de meuble"}

### Preview the supplied Société Générale sample CSV (does not persist transactions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/preview
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kontaBoundary

--kontaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="transactions-sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../sample/transactions-sample.csv
--kontaBoundary--

### Invalid extension returns 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/preview
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kontaInvalidBoundary

--kontaInvalidBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="not-a-csv.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not a CSV file.
--kontaInvalidBoundary--
